    notes:
    - pageIndex: 0
      title: "\u0130\u015Flem g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC"
      bookID: 
      sourceLocation: 
      explanation: "Yo\u011Funla\u015Ft\u0131rma yaln\u0131z renksiz ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131y\u0131
        azalt\u0131r. \xC7\xF6z\xFCc\xFC yeniden ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 ekler.
        Ayn\u0131 iki i\u015Flemi farkl\u0131 s\u0131rada deneyince farkl\u0131 numuneler
        elde edildi."
      blocks: []
    - pageIndex: 0
      title: "Referans\u0131n kullan\u0131m\u0131"
      bookID: 
      sourceLocation: 
      explanation: "Benzer renk tek ba\u015F\u0131na yeterli de\u011Fildir. Referans
        numunenin yo\u011Funlu\u011Funu ve kapta kalan miktar\u0131 da kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r;
        k\xFC\xE7\xFCk denemelerle ilerle."
